{"id":"n-20261020-2ttt1q","category":"gaming","display_title":"Storm's Legendary Skin Debate","display_title_he":"ויכוח סקינים האגדיים של סטורם","short_summary":"Rapper Sexyy Red joined fans in questioning Marvel Rivals developers about why the character Storm has so few Legendary skins, prompting developer responses and upcoming upgrades.","english_level":"C1","words":486,"reading_time":3,"image":null,"sources":[{"name":"IGN","domain":"ign.com","url":"https://www.ign.com/articles/even-sexyy-red-is-confused-why-storm-doesnt-have-more-legendary-skins","title":"Even Sexyy Red Is Confused Why Storm Doesn't Have More Legendary Skins","published_at":"2026-10-19T21:23:37.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:23:37.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-20T06:25:36.517Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":8,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["The popular multiplayer game Marvel Rivals has found itself at the center of an unexpected community debate concerning cosmetic items for one of its most prominent characters. Storm, the iconic Mistress of the Elements, shares a distinct status among the roster's female characters by possessing just a single Legendary skin. This limitation has long frustrated dedicated players, but the conversation recently reached a much wider audience when unexpected voices entered the discussion on social media.","Following an official statement posted by the game's social media accounts on October 15 regarding speech moderation, rapper Sexyy Red surprised both fans and observers by publicly addressing the developers. In a quote-retweet directed at the official Marvel Rivals page, the artist bluntly inquired when the character would finally receive another top-tier cosmetic item, writing directly to ask when they were going to give Storm her legendary skin. The unexpected intervention stunned the gaming community, with many followers expressing amusement while simultaneously amplifying her request for more costume options from the development teams at NetEase and Marvel Games.","The developers are well aware of the ongoing discussions surrounding Storm's wardrobe. Back in August, the team directly acknowledged the community's desire for more Legendary options. The tension peaked shortly after the introduction of Storm's swimsuit costume, titled Sacred Skies, which had been listed as an Epic skin at the time. Fans expressed immediate dismay upon discovering that, unlike the swimsuit skins given to other female characters included in the lineup, Storm's new outfit was the only one that wasn't a Legendary.","In direct response to this feedback, the official Marvel Rivals Twitter and X account announced its decision to upgrade the Sacred Skies skin to Legendary status for free. Although developers noted that the process would take time and asked for patience, the community's attention has also turned toward potential future additions. Based on leaked character silhouettes for an upcoming skin line and reports from game journalists like Miller Ross, players speculate that upcoming Marvel Tokon Fighting Souls crossover costumes might soon introduce fresh aesthetic options for characters like Storm and Iron Man, mirroring poses from the three-versus-three tag fighting game.","If this crossover proves true, it will not be the first collaboration between Marvel games and Fighting Souls. Previous instances include Marvel's Wolverine receiving a cel-shaded skin directly from Arc System Works, alongside a more realistic costume inspired by Insomniac's action-adventure title. Despite the impending upgrades and future rumors, data shows that Storm is hardly alone in her predicament. Characters such as Jubilee, Black Widow, and Angela are similarly limited to a single Legendary skin each, whereas characters like Emma Frost boast a much larger wardrobe, to the point where some fans are ready for her to share closet space with the rest of the gals. As developers continue working on the promised cosmetic enhancements, the community remains eager to see how the teams will balance character wardrobes across the entire roster."],"facts":[{"fact":"Storm is one of several female characters in Marvel Rivals with only one Legendary skin.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Rapper Sexyy Red posted on social media asking the official Marvel Rivals account when Storm will receive another Legendary skin.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Marvel Rivals developers NetEase and Marvel Games previously addressed the lack of Legendary skins for Storm in August.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Fans expressed disappointment when Storm's Sacred Skies swimsuit skin debuted as an Epic tier instead of Legendary, prompting developers to announce a free upgrade.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Rumors and character silhouettes suggest a crossover with Marvel Tokon Fighting Souls could bring more costumes for characters like Storm and Iron Man.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Other female characters in the game, such as Jubilee, Black Widow, and Angela, also have only one Legendary skin, while Emma Frost has many.","sources":[1]}],"glossary":[{"text":"popular","lemma":"popular","pos":"adjective","he":"פופולרי","name":false},{"text":"multiplayer","lemma":"multiplayer","pos":"adjective","he":"רב-משתתפים","name":false},{"text":"game","lemma":"game","pos":"noun","he":"משחק","name":false},{"text":"Marvel Rivals","lemma":"Marvel Rivals","pos":"proper noun","he":"מרוול ריוואלס","name":true},{"text":"found","lemma":"find","pos":"verb","he":"מצא","name":false},{"text":"center","lemma":"center","pos":"noun","he":"מרכז","name":false},{"text":"unexpected","lemma":"unexpected","pos":"adjective","he":"בלתי צפוי","name":false},{"text":"community","lemma":"community","pos":"noun","he":"קהילה","name":false},{"text":"debate","lemma":"debate","pos":"noun","he":"דיון / ויכוח","name":false},{"text":"concerning","lemma":"concerning","pos":"preposition","he":"בנוגע ל","name":false},{"text":"cosmetic","lemma":"cosmetic","pos":"adject